<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs $0.50/1.00 off - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs $0.50/1.00 off - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts opened $0.50-1.00 lower. Demand moderate to light. Top $60.00 per cwt. - USDA US 1-2  230-260 lbs. 58.50-59.50, mostly 59.00-59.50, few 60.00 Sows: Steady to 1.00 lower. Top 50.00. US 1-3  300-500 lbs. 43.00-46.00, few 47.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 46.00-48.00</p>
<p>few over  600 lbs. 47.00-49.00, few 50.00</p>
</text>
